        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/35a633/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-04-18T13:25:06.314Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, don’t give up on the GTG team just yet. Look at how far they’ve come already, and all the obstacles they’ve overcome to accomplish everything they have! They’ve grown an entire franchise from scratch in a very competive environment, created an entire very loyal community, and published more Sentinels peoducts than I cam count off the top of my head. It may take awhile, but I believe they’ll find a way to recover from this. After all, they are the real Sentinels of the Multiverse!</p>",
